// BT-3704 (ADR 0130 Phase 1): the class-variable semantics matrix for the
// subclass override (base rows, subclass writer). Each test asserts the ADR 0130 section 4/5 answer; a test
// whose current answer differs pins today's answer and carries a PIN-BUG marker
// citing BT-3713 (the Phase 3 flip issue), which flips every pin.
//
// PENDING: the rows these tests call do not compile today (see the matching
// fixture); the assertions are the ADR 0130 answers and nothing is pinned.

TestCase subclass: ClassVarSemanticsOverridePendingTest

  // ADR 0130 §4 (BT-3694 shape)
  testLoopCondition =>
    self assert: CvsOverrideSubPending rowLoopCondition equals: 3

  // ADR 0130 §4 catch boundary
  testNonMatchingInnerOnDoWithEnsureBetween =>
    self assert: CvsOverrideSubPending rowNonMatchingInnerEnsure equals: 0
